00:10:34.380 --> 00:10:40.520
the Strait of Hormuz function as leverage points in a complex global energy system where control of

00:10:40.520 --> 00:10:46.780
transit creates asymmetric power regardless of who produces the oil. Roughly 20% of global seaborn

00:10:46.780 --> 00:10:52.360
