00:11:12.740 --> 00:11:18.800
Historical parallels include the 1973 oil crisis when Arab producers used export embargoes rather

00:11:18.800 --> 00:11:24.620
than physical blockades in the 1980s tanker war when both Iraq and Iran attacked commercial shipping.

00:11:25.180 --> 00:11:30.000
Today's situation combines elements of both physical blockade threats plus market psychology.

